### 5. PROBLEMS — CREAR / LISTAR / MODIFICAR
### ============================

### ANA — Crear Binary Search (201); guardar ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/study-blocks/{{anaBlockId}}/problems
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{anaSessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{anaCsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Binary Search",
  "difficulty": "EASY",
  "algorithm": "Binary Search",
  "solved": false,
  "notes": "Review left and right limits",
  "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/binary-search/"
}

> {%
client.global.set("anaProblemId", response.body.id);
%}

### ANA — Crear Problem con título únicamente (201); guardar ID
